{"strongs": "H2731", "word": "חֲרָדָה", "translit": "cha.ra.dah", "root": "חרגל", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "trembling, fear, anxiety", "definition": "I. חֲרָדָה noun feminine trembling, fear, anxiety — חֲרָדָה Gen 27:33 + 5 t. + Ezek 38:21 (read for הָרַי , B Co compare Dr 1Sam 14:15 ); construct חֶרְדַּת 1Sam 14:15 ; Prov 29:25 (see Lag BN 113 ); plural חֲרָדוֺת Ezek 26:16 — 1. trembling, quaking (of terror ascribed to supernatural cause) 1Sam 14:15 (twice in verse) (hence אלהים ׳ ח see Dr ; || וַתִּרְגַּזהֿארץ ) compare Ezek 38:21 (see above); Dan 10:7 ׳ קול ח Jer 30:5 voice of trembling ; followed by genitive object אָדָם ׳ ח Prov 29:25 trembling before man ; opposed to pleasure Isa 21:4 tremblings (plural) Ezek 26:16 under figure of garment ( ילבשׁו ׳ ח ), of effect on coast-princes of fall of Tyre. 2. anxious care 2Kgs 4:13 , accusative of congnate meaning with verb with חָרַד .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3105')\">BDB3105</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2731')\">H2731</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3104')\">BDB3104</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3106')\">BDB3106</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>חֲרָדָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>trembling, fear, anxiety</highlightword> — <bdbheb>חֲרָדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,33)\">Gen 27:33</ref> + 5 t. + <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,21)\">Ezek 38:21</ref> (read for <bdbheb>הָרַי</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><reflink>B</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,15)\">1Sam 14:15</ref>); construct <bdbheb>חֶרְדַּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin